This is a super casual ball ball infinite parkour game, the unique color dodge ball makes the game unique;
Two colored balls, two colors, will be eaten when they encounter the same color, avoiding balls and borders of different colors;

The operation is very simple, sliding the screen to control the left and right movement of the two balls, the key to the game when mastering the rhythm;
Invite friends to play together, who is the infinite ball god in the rankings, a game suitable for everyone to play.

Ball Run is an arcade game about a rolling ball. Control the ball, avoid obstacles and collect energy to keep moving.

The game requires attention and reaction: dodge collisions with obstacles and pick up energy items so the ball keeps rolling. Set your own record and try to beat it.

Features:
- simple and responsive controls;
- various obstacles on the way;
- energy items to keep the ball moving;
- minimalistic graphics;
- small download size.

Download Ball Run and see how far you can roll!
